cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software release."
title: "Gaze-Aware Stereo Vision ADAS"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-04

abstract: >-
  Research software for real-time driver gaze estimation, stereo-vision-based
  depth processing, ADAS object detection, gaze projection, time-to-collision
  estimation, and driver-attention warning analysis using dual OAK-D cameras.

